            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kayla Ortiz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "YUM. Our household of 3 young professionals loved the spice! I do like sweet and spicy though so my one tweek was adding a tablespoon of honey! I used Israel couscous same flavor, I think better texture. Thank you so much it's a keeper!",
