            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ptulip"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It is a refreshing side dish or a main meal with your protein added. I placed this in my recipe box to make again. I did follow some of the reviews, I added approximately a 1/4 cup of olive oil, and increased the lemon juice to taste.",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-31T12:36:10.960Z"
          },
          {
