              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ange82"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Ooo girl! There’s a “kick” and then there’s 2tsp of cayenne lol. LOVED this and the flavors were incredible. Next time I will cut down the cayenne a bit, add some extra larger chunks of cucumber, stick with doubling the feta. Family added tomatoes and I added yogurt because at one point I literally said, “I’m want to cut my tongue off and throw it out the window.” So good though!!!",
